Package: fast.string
Type: Package
Title: Fast Parallel String Functions via PCRE2 and RcppParallel
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Kyle", "Haynes", email = "kyle@kylehaynes.com.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Description: Fast equivalents of grepl(), grep(), sub(), and gsub() that
    use PCRE2 for regular expressions and prepared literal search for fixed
    strings, parallelised across CPU cores via Intel TBB through
    RcppParallel. Includes a reproducible benchmark harness for measuring
    workload- and platform-specific performance.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
