    stringdist,
    RecordLinkage,
    phonics,
    microbenchmark,
    knitr
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppParallel (>= 5.1.1)
SystemRequirements: C++14, GNU make
Config/testthat/edition: 3
